44
00:03:50,644 --> 00:03:53,596
[Host] It means a line, or here, a wire.

45
00:03:54,195 --> 00:03:56,068
[Vocab] かむ

46
00:03:56,467 --> 00:03:58,340
[Host] It means to bite.

47
00:03:58,939 --> 00:04:01,219
[Vocab] 危ない

48
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:03,491
[Host] It means dangerous.

49
00:04:04,092 --> 00:04:10,403
[Slow] それで、会社はこの飛行機を欠航にしました。

50
00:04:11,204 --> 00:04:13,699
[Host] So the company cancelled the flight.

51
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:16,579
[Vocab] 欠航

52
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:20,963
[Host] It means a cancelled flight, used for planes and ships.

53
00:04:21,564 --> 00:04:27,899
[Slow] 午後4時になっても、動物は見つかりませんでした。

54
00:04:28,699 --> 00:04:33,139
[Host] Even at four in the afternoon, the animal still had not been found.

55
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:36,019
[Vocab] 見つかる

56
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:40,620
[Host] It means to be found. It is the partner of the verb to find.

57
00:04:41,220 --> 00:04:46,307
[Slow] 何の動物か、まだわかっていません。

58
00:04:47,108 --> 00:04:49,891
[Host] Nobody knows yet what kind of animal it was.

59
00:04:50,492 --> 00:04:52,387
[Vocab] まだ

60
00:04:52,788 --> 00:04:55,091
[Host] It means still, or not yet.

61
00:04:55,692 --> 00:05:04,427
[Slow] 会社は「小さい動物で欠航になるのは珍しいです」と話しました。

62
00:05:05,228 --> 00:05:10,172
[Host] The company said it is rare for a flight to be cancelled because of a small animal.

63
00:05:10,771 --> 00:05:13,291
[Vocab] 珍しい

64
00:05:13,692 --> 00:05:16,355
[Host] It means rare, or unusual.

65
